  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\n- Release notes on nuget.org no longer show markdown escape backslashes (#395, closes #393). The notes went through a converter that escaped every character that could start markdown, so code such as Arg<int>.Is(5), _ => { } and $GITHUB_OUTPUT reached the package as Arg\\<int>, \\_ => and $GITHUB\\_OUTPUT. A small script in the repository now drops only the markup the notes use, and the package smoke test checks the converted text on every pull request.\n\nNo change to the generator or the runtime API. Since 1.0.0, the generated method imposters also name their cached field _latestInvocationImposter (#394); the field is private, so nothing changes for callers.",
